sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Customer / Rider
  participant UI as Web Portal
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

  User->>UI: Enters Vehicle Reg No
  UI->>API: GET /api/public/tracker?regNo=MH02AB1234
  API->>DB: Query Active Job & Repair Stage
  DB-->>API: Return Job, Spares & Progress
  API-->>UI: 200 OK (Stage 3 of 5: Repair In Progress)
  UI-->>User: Displays Real-time Progress Bar
